"0:25.503">自</span><span begin="0:25.503" end="0:27.834">找</span></p></div><div begin="0:46.414" end="1:25.862" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:46.414" end="0:50.041" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.414" end="0:48.682">我知道我并没有</span><span begin="0:48.682" end="0:50.041">他好</span></p><p begin="0:50.705" end="0:55.425" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.705" end="0:53.848">也知道你不需要别人来</span><span begin="0:53.848" end="0:55.425">讨好</span></p><p begin="0:55.847" end="1:00.589" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.847" end="0:59.014">你说给我的爱会晚一点</span><span begin="0:59.014" end="1:00.589">才到</span></p><p begin="1:01.251" end="1:05.795" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.251" end="1:04.191">你打破了你自己开的</span><span begin="1:04.191" end="1:05.795">玩笑</span></p><p begin="1:07.194" end="1:10.901" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.194" end="1:09.242">我总放心放你的</span><span begin="1:09.242" end="1:10.901">心飘</span></p><p begin="1:11.403" end="1:16.166" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.403" end="1:14.202">你竟相信他随口要的</span><span begin="1:14.202" end="1:14.544">依</span><span begin="1:14.544" end="1:16.166">靠</span></p><p begin="1:16.531" end="1:21.372" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.531" end="1:19.578">你怪我怎么没有把你给</span><span begin="1:19.578" end="1:21.372">守好</span></p><p begin="1:21.733" end="1:25.862" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.733" end="1:24.457">我没有恨你 你就应该</span><span begin="1:24.457" end="1:24.887">偷</span><span begin="1:24.887" end="1:25.862">笑</span></p></div><div begin="1:26.132" end="2:11.113" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:26.132" end="1:31.281" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.132" end="1:27.644">谁稀罕</span> <span begin="1:27.782" end="1:30.044">轰轰烈烈童话般</span><span begin="1:30.044" end="1:31.281">的爱</span></p><p begin="1:31.369" end="1:36.453" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.369" end="1:32.927">就习惯</span>